      "text": "Pick–up from thee hotel at 04:30a.m (breakfast: lunchbox)\n\nWe are going to the highest point of Panama on this exhilarating Jeep 4x4 tour of Barú Volcano. On a clear day, this chilly volcano peak offers incredible views of both the Caribbean and Pacific. Bundle up and get ready for the off-roading experience of a lifetime. \n\nIn the afternoon a SIB tour to suspension bridges will be conducted.",
